<title>BELARUS: Belarussian rouble fixed lower at 14,550 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Belarussian rouble fixed lower at 14,550 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belarussian rouble edged down to 14,550 per dollar on the Minsk Interbank Currency Exchange, from 14,500.</p>
<p>				    September 3	   September 2</p>
<p> Dollar rate		    14,550		  14,500</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $2.678 million	$3.139 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
